  "body": "When there is contention, `Linearizer` sleeps upon acquiring a lock and thus needs access to a reactor.\r\nIt turns out that the reactor used by `Linearizer` is _different_ to the reactor used by the `HomeServer` during tests.\r\nThere is no `Linearizer` contention in our tests, so we don't notice this bug.",
